{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the creators of CONARIUM, TRANSIENT, and the DARKNESS WITHIN series comes \u201cVeil of Madness,\u201d an eerie deck-building game where a doctor enters his patient's mind to find that her coma is not an illness, but a startling evolution. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889330/extras/387a18095b52a876f283b754fc8a49e9.avif?t=1750428936\" width=600 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889330/extras/fddd137f6c8ec42c4f0b7b24647c0e0d.avif?t=1750428936\" width=600 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889330/extras/e8093c0a5fdc9cbcef6b5bc9a506ba7c.avif?t=1750428936\" width=600 height=80 /></span>Gather unique cards along the way and upgrade them to improve their stats. Some cards can be found in secret areas, while others are only obtainable by completing certain quests. Therefore, pay attention to NPCs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889330/extras/5bc6a96d94dd3cbd6eb3e3c8c23d3613.poster.avif?t=1750428936\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889330/extras/5bc6a96d94dd3cbd6eb3e3c8c23d3613.webm?t=1750428936\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889330/extras/5bc6a96d94dd3cbd6eb3e3c8c23d3613.mp4?t=1750428936\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889330/extras/01008a61d7d61157c73af0a0a3f92283.avif?t=1750428936\" width=600 height=80 /></span>You will encounter various creatures throughout the game. At times, you may need to battle more than one. Use your inventory strategically to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889330/extras/12f463edb828ba809912cf40250d9cb3.poster.avif?t=1750428936\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889330/extras/12f463edb828ba809912cf40250d9cb3.webm?t=1750428936\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889330/extras/12f463edb828ba809912cf40250d9cb3.mp4?t=1750428936\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2889330?t=1750428936","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889330/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1750428936","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889330/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1750428936","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889330/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1750428936","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the creators of CONARIUM, TRANSIENT, and the DARKNESS WITHIN series comes \u201cVeil of Madness,\u201d an eerie deck-building game where a doctor enters his patient's mind to find that her coma is not an illness, but a startling evolution. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889330/extras/387a18095b52a876f283b754fc8a49e9.avif?t=1750428936\" width=600 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889330/extras/fddd137f6c8ec42c4f0b7b24647c0e0d.avif?t=1750428936\" width=600 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889330/extras/e8093c0a5fdc9cbcef6b5bc9a506ba7c.avif?t=1750428936\" width=600 height=80 /></span>Gather unique cards along the way and upgrade them to improve their stats. Some cards can be found in secret areas, while others are only obtainable by completing certain quests. Therefore, pay attention to NPCs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889330/extras/5bc6a96d94dd3cbd6eb3e3c8c23d3613.poster.avif?t=1750428936\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889330/extras/5bc6a96d94dd3cbd6eb3e3c8c23d3613.webm?t=1750428936\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889330/extras/5bc6a96d94dd3cbd6eb3e3c8c23d3613.mp4?t=1750428936\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889330